WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.700
Convertix: JPG → PNG → PDF on KDE.

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:05.700
We start with a JPG screenshot of the portfolio.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.800
Open Convertix from Dolphin’s context menu.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.500
Choose PNG from the format menu.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.700
Convertix saves the PNG and keeps the original JPG.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.700
Open the PNG in Gwenview to check the result.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.800
Back in Dolphin, select the generated PNG.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.200
This time, choose PDF.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.700
The second conversion creates portafolio.pdf.

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:37.800
Open the PDF in Okular: one page containing the image.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Return to the demonstration folder.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:44.000
Original JPG, PNG and PDF: three local files.
